{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "1789813265000-216392", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "下半年办公用品盘点怎么做不漏项？", "id": "c18a3e41f57b44ffadb73efead99665f", "created_at": "2026-09-19T10:21:05", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "e4af529c275e44808d6399d8117e5aaf", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-19T10:21:05", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "理解用户诉求后，结合公司数据与制度作答，保持简洁准确。", "id": "c7370ddd0cf940fda9c26a0c2b3fe2ad", "created_at": "2026-09-19T10:21:13", "finished_at": "2026-09-19T10:21:45"}, {"type": "text", "text": "盘点四步：\n1. 以 6 月末台账为底表，逐项核对实物；\n2. 按部门分区盘点，行政+部门各一人签字；\n3. 差异当日记录：盘盈入账、盘亏查明原因后核销；\n4. 盘点表行政存档 + 财务备案。\n重点盯耐用品（打印机、碎纸机、对讲机），低值易耗按金额>100 元的登记。", "id": "3ac3313c7a7343878b3d4a69240f5f4f", "created_at": "2026-09-19T10:21:13", "finished_at": "2026-09-19T10:21:45"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "500bab0f2d68457493f5cbacbd54ec0e", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-19T10:21:13", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-19T10:21:45", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "盘点报告的格式给个框架。", "id": "0a693aecffd44b378096f0455e272093", "created_at": "2026-09-19T10:25:05", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "70bb4b78df364faba815635488782c60", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-19T10:25:05", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "理解用户诉求后，结合公司数据与制度作答，保持简洁准确。", "id": "8742cc7ba0b94695ac6050cf13dab18b", "created_at": "2026-09-19T10:25:13", "finished_at": "2026-09-19T10:25:45"}, {"type": "text", "text": "**办公用品盘点报告**\n一、盘点时间/范围/人员\n二、结果：账面 X 项、实盘 X 项、差异 X 项（附明细表）\n三、差异原因：损耗未销账 / 借用未还 / 登记遗漏\n四、处理建议：核销清单 + 制度改进 1–2 条\n五、附件：盘点明细表（部门签字版）", "id": "8d0520c7f10f4de6be14bc017c53b6f3", "created_at": "2026-09-19T10:25:13", "finished_at": "2026-09-19T10:25:45"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "d57f77c3ce0b4f16973feadf6c02eb24", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-19T10:25:13", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-19T10:25:45", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "盘点发现账实不符先调账还是先查原因？", "id": "2aff3b21e0824adcb34282717be929d2", "created_at": "2026-09-19T10:27:45", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "8978c414b2794121884fe99557e5aaad", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-19T10:27:45", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "d539855b3e9b40688351d13a06e8a9f1", "created_at": "2026-09-19T10:27:51", "finished_at": "2026-09-19T10:28:30"}, {"type": "text", "text": "先查原因再调账。直接调账会把管理问题埋进数字里；查明原因后：管理责任走核销审批，登记遗漏补录入账。财务要的是“差异可解释”，不是“差异为零”。", "id": "7f61318f2a5141d4b50068cd9bd78c0c", "created_at": "2026-09-19T10:27:51", "finished_at": "2026-09-19T10:28:30"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "c62edc57aec74406b565955e30b72a43", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-19T10:27:51", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-19T10:28:30", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "各部门的盘点时间怎么协调？", "id": "f933da869b454503ac344cf0d7a4f351", "created_at": "2026-09-19T10:32:30", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "eeb01c4e4dff44fa8e8dfad763d444b7", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-19T10:32:30", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "9db718bd1e9446beace19a40541268f0", "created_at": "2026-09-19T10:32:36", "finished_at": "2026-09-19T10:33:08"}, {"type": "text", "text": "错峰安排：行政+财务先盘公共区（会议室/前台/仓库），再按周排部门——每周 2 个部门、利用生产部倒班间隙；全部盘点控制在两周内，避免跨月台账变动。", "id": "36efd177316346fa998264fe258a6daf", "created_at": "2026-09-19T10:32:36", "finished_at": "2026-09-19T10:33:08"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "f6158532f3bb432a9676681bdd66a260", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-19T10:32:36", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-19T10:33:08", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "盘点差异怎么追责？", "id": "6489680c7e984b1093883b988a58db06", "created_at": "2026-09-19T10:34:08", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "f19123ae743d4959847fead1fbdaf15b", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-19T10:34:08", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "40f692c4c580493fb438273473bc63e5", "created_at": "2026-09-19T10:34:14", "finished_at": "2026-09-19T10:34:44"}, {"type": "text", "text": "分级：正常损耗未销账补手续即可；借用未还限期归还并通报；金额较大且去向不明的报部门经理+财务会审，人为原因按制度赔偿。台账准比追责重要。", "id": "9b31598e63134adbb1afc30d3b634959", "created_at": "2026-09-19T10:34:14", "finished_at": "2026-09-19T10:34:44"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "581cbf96ec5c46e7b1c016eb91241604", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-19T10:34:14", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-19T10:34:44", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}], "reply_context": {}, "permission_context": {}, "tool_context": {}, "tasks_context": {}, "middle_context": {}}}}